---
title: "State Machine: SwapRequest"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Posted
    Posted --> Claimed : claim
    Posted --> Withdrawn : withdraw
    Claimed --> Approved : approve
    Claimed --> Denied : deny
    Claimed --> Expired : shift start passes
    Approved --> [*]
    Denied --> [*]

    note right of Posted
        A claim that fails a blocking rule is refused
        before a SwapRequest reaches Claimed.
    end note
